{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/ai/send-context-webhook","title":"Send application context to AI","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"send-application-context-to-ai","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Send application context to AI"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextToAi"},{"t":"text","text":" adds a developer-oriented context inspector to a Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application. It is useful when an AI assistant needs more than a copied error"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"message: the selected component, the recent user journey, the relevant app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"state, and optionally the DOM and computed CSS."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Typical uses include:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"asking an AI assistant to explain or fix a broken screen;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"preparing a reproducible bug report or a support ticket;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"investigating a failed HTTP request, navigation, mutation, or query;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"sending a consistent, structured context to an internal debugging agent."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The feature is user-driven. It does not call an AI service by itself. Without"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"an "},{"t":"code","text":"endpoint"},{"t":"text","text":", everything stays in the browser and the user copies the prompt"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"or the timeline when they choose to. The required "},{"t":"code","text":"recording"},{"t":"text","text":" option decides"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"when capture starts: "},{"t":"code","text":"true"},{"t":"text","text":" starts a session clip automatically at app startup;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"false"},{"t":"text","text":" waits until the user clicks "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Record"}]},{"t":"text","text":". In either mode, the user can"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stop and manually start recording from the timeline controls. Events are only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"captured while a recording clip is active."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"minimal-setup","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Minimal setup"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Register the provider once in the application providers. The default UI then"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"adds an "},{"t":"code","text":"AI context"},{"t":"text","text":" launcher in the bottom-right corner and a context menu to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft component hosts. The minimal setup opts in to session recording:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"minimalAiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" })];","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The two entry points are equivalent:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"open the launcher to start with an empty context, then interact with the app;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"right-click a component to start with that component already selected."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"From the chat, the user can add more elements with another right-click, remove"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"selected elements, write an instruction, record or clear the timeline, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"choose which sections to include in the generated Markdown prompt."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-is-collected","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What is collected"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The session combines several kinds of context:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Selected elements"}]},{"t":"text","text":": tag name, text, outer HTML, and optionally a selector."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Component information"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the host name, Craft host tags, click coordinates,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the clicked element, and truncated host HTML."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Timeline"}]},{"t":"text","text":": DOM interactions, HTTP requests, router activity, primitive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"activity, and app snapshot reports. HTTP and navigation entries are linked by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"operation and correlation IDs when those services provide them."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"App snapshots"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the reports emitted by the app snapshot registry while the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"context is being prepared."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"DOM and CSS captures"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the selected component or the full page, including"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"computed styles. These captures are optional because they can be large and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"briefly pause the page while they are collected."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The default prompt contains selected elements, component information, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"timeline summary, and app snapshots when they exist. Timeline JSON and DOM/CSS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"captures are opt-in. The checkboxes in the chat change the Markdown prompt;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the webhook also receives the structured fields so an agent can process them"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"without parsing Markdown."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The chat also supports recording a named "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"clip"}]},{"t":"text","text":". A clip is a subset of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"timeline, which is useful when an investigation contains several unrelated"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"interactions. "},{"t":"code","text":"Copy JSON"},{"t":"text","text":" copies a versioned export of the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"full session"}]},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"regardless of which clip is selected. "},{"t":"code","text":"Copy prompt"},{"t":"text","text":" builds the AI-oriented"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Markdown document. "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Clear"}]},{"t":"text","text":" removes the current timeline and, if recording"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"was active, starts a fresh clip so the next reproduction can be captured."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"export-and-replay-a-debugging-session","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Export and replay a debugging session"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use the timeline's "},{"t":"code","text":"Record"},{"t":"text","text":" control while reproducing an issue, then choose"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"Copy JSON"},{"t":"text","text":" to copy the complete session. The export includes the starting URL,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the event timeline, clips, and recorded HTTP request/response data. DOM events"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"include a replay target and action; form values and relevant keyboard details"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"are included when available. Password fields and fields whose names indicate"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"secrets are omitted, and the normal send-context redactor runs before data is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exported. Events from the debugging overlay itself are excluded."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In the local app, open the context panel, paste the JSON into "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Replay a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"session"}]},{"t":"text","text":", and choose "},{"t":"code","text":"Validate"},{"t":"text","text":". Invalid JSON, unsupported versions, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"sessions marked as truncated are rejected. Retention can evict old events, so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"an export with lost events is explicitly marked incomplete and cannot be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"replayed as a complete session."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For the most useful replay, first reload the local app on the recorded path,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"then reopen the panel, paste the export again, and validate it. The origin in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the export may belong to another environment; replay compares request paths"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and uses the current local app. It re-runs the app's code and interactions; it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not restore the app's complete initial state."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"After validation, use:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"Play"},{"t":"text","text":" to replay interactions at the intervals recorded in the session;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"Pause"},{"t":"text","text":" to hold replay before the next interaction;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"Next step"},{"t":"text","text":" to dispatch one interaction and advance Craft's virtual clock"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to that event's recorded time;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"Stop"},{"t":"text","text":" to end replay and restore the normal Craft clock and "},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Recorded HTTP responses are returned for matching "},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":" requests. A request"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with no recorded match stops replay and is rejected; it is never sent through"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":" to the server. Matching uses the request method, local path and query,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"body, and recorded order. Craft timers scheduled through "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftTemporalRuntime"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and progressive "},{"t":"code","text":"scheduleFor"},{"t":"text","text":" rendering use the replay clock: they remain"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"paused between steps and run when replay advances time. Direct calls by the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application to native timers or animation-frame APIs are outside this virtual"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"clock's control."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Events that include a captured state can be compared with state observed after"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"replay. A mismatch is reported in the panel so the interaction can be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"investigated; replay does not force the recorded state back into the app."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"send-the-context-to-an-agent","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Send the context to an agent"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass a browser-accessible webhook URL to enable the "},{"t":"code","text":"Send"},{"t":"text","text":" action:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"aiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  endpoint: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'https://agent.example.com/hooks/context'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The browser sends a JSON "},{"t":"code","text":"POST"},{"t":"text","text":" with this versioned shape:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"version\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"prompt\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"# Instruction","kind":"string"},{"text":"\\n","kind":"string"},{"text":"Investigate this screen\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"instruction\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"Investigate this screen\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"selectedElements\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"events\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"snapshot\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"captures\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {},","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"component\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"hostName\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"OrdersPage\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"tagList\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"component:OrdersPage#1\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"coords\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"x\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"120","kind":"number"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"y\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"80","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"outerHTML\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"<section>…</section>\"","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"json","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"prompt"},{"t":"text","text":" is generated from the instruction, the selected options, and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"structured fields. "},{"t":"code","text":"component"},{"t":"text","text":" is omitted when the chat was opened from the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"launcher without a captured component. "},{"t":"code","text":"captures.component"},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"captures.page"},{"t":"text","text":" are present only when their corresponding DOM/CSS options were"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"selected. Events generated by the webhook request itself are excluded from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the context sent to that webhook."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Any "},{"t":"code","text":"2xx"},{"t":"text","text":" response is successful, including "},{"t":"code","text":"200"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"202"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"204"},{"t":"text","text":". Network"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failures, timeouts, and non-"},{"t":"code","text":"2xx"},{"t":"text","text":" responses are shown in the chat. "},{"t":"code","text":"Retry"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reuses the exact same payload, and "},{"t":"code","text":"Copy payload"},{"t":"text","text":" copies that payload only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"after a failed request."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The endpoint is application configuration shipped to the browser, not a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"secret. It must allow the application's origin through CORS and accept JSON"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"POST"},{"t":"text","text":" requests. Put authentication and secret management in a protected"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"same-origin proxy or agent gateway."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"configure-the-webhook","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Configure the webhook"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextToAi"},{"t":"text","text":" currently accepts the browser-accessible "},{"t":"code","text":"endpoint"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Omit it to keep the experience copy-only, or pass a URL to enable sending:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"customizedAiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  endpoint: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/internal/ai/context'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Treat that URL as public application configuration. Put authentication,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"redaction, and any tenant-specific policy in a protected same-origin proxy or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"agent gateway; never put credentials in the browser bundle."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The session and its record controller are also injectable:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  SEND_CONTEXT_RECORD_CONTROLLER,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  SEND_CONTEXT_SESSION,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ɵinject ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"as","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" inject } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"record"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"inject","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"SEND_CONTEXT_RECORD_CONTROLLER"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"startRecord","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Checkout failure'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// Later, from the same application flow:","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"stopRecord","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"summary"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exportSummary","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"json"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exportJson","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"session"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"inject","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"SEND_CONTEXT_SESSION"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"session.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"capture","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'custom'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'emitted'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'checkout.validation'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  state: { step: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'payment'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use the record controller for clips and the session for low-level event"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"emission, subscription, clearing, and programmatic export."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"customize-the-ui-with-di","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Customize the UI with DI"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"There are three levels of UI customization:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Provider"}],[{"t":"text","text":"What it replaces or adds"}],[{"t":"text","text":"When to use it"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextChatComponent(() => MyChat)"}],[{"t":"text","text":"The default chat panel"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep the built-in launcher and context menu, but replace the panel"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextUiRenderer(() => MyRenderer)"}],[{"t":"text","text":"The complete renderer"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Own the launcher/chat lifecycle and render the whole experience"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"SEND_CONTEXT_LAUNCHER_COMPONENT"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"SEND_CONTEXT_CONTEXT_MENU_COMPONENT"}],[{"t":"text","text":"The floating launcher or right-click menu"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Match the application's controls or visual language"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The complete renderer receives "},{"t":"code","text":"SendContextUiContext"},{"t":"text","text":". It exposes the live"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"session, events, clips, selected targets, captured payload, DOM capture element,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"recording state, endpoint, and operations such as "},{"t":"code","text":"addTarget"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"removeTarget"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"selectClip"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"close"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideSendContextChatComponent,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideSendContextUiRenderer,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" SendContextUiContext,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// A chat replacement keeps the default surrounding behavior.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideSendContextChatComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" MyChat);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// A complete renderer receives the live context as its `context` input.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideSendContextUiRenderer","kind":"function"},{"text":"(() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" MyRenderer);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// MyRenderer's input contract is:","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// { context: Input<SendContextUiContext>; onClose: Output<() => void> }","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextChatSection"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextChatAction"},{"t":"text","text":", and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextExportSection"},{"t":"text","text":" are multi providers intended for a custom"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"renderer. They let feature libraries contribute sections, commands, or export"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"views without depending on one global renderer. The built-in chat does not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"render those extension entries itself; a custom renderer reads them from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"SendContextUiContext"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For example, a feature can contribute an action that starts a named clip:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideSendContextChatAction } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"providers"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"provideSendContextChatAction","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    id: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'record-checkout'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    label: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Record checkout flow'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"run","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"context"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" context.session.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"startRecord","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Checkout flow'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"];","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The UI provider tokens are reg